1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,000
In this video we shall review how to perform bulk actions with scans.

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:14,720
The bulk actions menu enables you to cancel or delete multiple scans at the same time.

3
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:19,360
You can also use the scan again option to scan the selected sites again using the same

4
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:22,000
configurations as before.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,480
To perform bulk actions on scans, first select the scans tab and then toggle which scans

6
00:00:29,480 --> 00:00:32,300
you want to include in the bulk actions.

7
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:39,040
And from the pop-up we can choose to scan again, cancel any in progress scans or delete the

8
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:41,040
scans altogether.

9
00:00:41,040 --> 00:00:42,600
Thank you.

